                                                "sense_id": "f2135f2a-cae9-3f50-9849-cf2d68bc4fed",
                                                "text": "Outside the boundaries of the PTEs [Passenger Transport Executives], there was little mechanism to re-open routes, and despite a growing realisation that the lack of transport connectivity was a big contributor towards social deprivation and poor economic performance, there was little government policy recognition."
                                            }
